        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "应用信息"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                100,
                642,
                200,
                663
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "BP5132HC 是一款高精度可控硅线性恒流 LED 控制芯片，主要用于驱动由120Vac供电的高电压、低电流 LED灯串。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                99,
                671,
                484,
                726
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "1 供电"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                100,
                737,
                159,
                753
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "在系统上电后，D 端通过内部的高压 JFET 给芯片供电，当D端的电压超过10V之后芯片开始工作。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                99,
                765,
                482,
                801
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "2 恒流控制，输出电流设置"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                99,
                810,
                319,
                828
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "BP5132HC可以通过外部电阻精确设定 LED电流。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                99,
                839,
                470,
                856
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "LED 导通时，输出电流计算公式："
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                99,
                866,
                356,
                884
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "equation_interline",
            "content": {
                "math_content": "I _ {L E D} = \\frac {V r e f}{R c s}",
                "math_type": "latex",
                "image_source": {
                    "path": "images/01252df991440cf0c2478b71ceeef638e9b14a4476ff2ff891d2a4030bb470c8.jpg"
                }
            },
            "bbox": [
                586,
                636,
                687,
                670
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "BP5132HC不适用于220Vac输入并且输出有电容的高 PF 应用；由于散热能力的限制，在 120V 市电输入时，建议将芯片输出电流设在 80mA以下。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                510,
                671,
                897,
                727
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "3 调光控制"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                512,
                734,
                608,
                751
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "BP5132HC内部具备两路线性芯片,其中一路提供调光器的维持电流,另外一路实现 LED恒流输出;除此之外,芯片的两个取样电阻通过特殊的连接方式,实现了动态调整维持电流的控制方式。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                510,
                760,
                887,
                834
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_number",
            "content": {
                "page_number_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "5"
                    }
                ]
            },
